{
"recipe_id":"12 No Churn Homemade Ice Cream",
"source_text":"Recipe text:\n\n1. 分离蛋清和蛋黄，只保留蛋黄；蛋黄中加入白糖和几滴柠檬汁或醋，用电动打蛋器搅拌至颜色变浅。\n2. 牛奶倒入小锅，小火加热至表面开始冒泡后关火；将热牛奶慢慢倒入蛋黄液，同时快速搅拌，避免蛋黄结块。\n3. 将蛋奶液倒回小锅，加入少量盐，小火加热并持续快速搅拌，直到液体微微煮开；关火放凉。\n4. 淡奶油打发至约九分发。\n5. 将打发好的淡奶油加入冷却后的蛋奶液，搅拌均匀，倒入带盖容器，冷冻至少 3 小时。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "分离蛋清和蛋黄，只保留蛋黄", "text_en": "Separate the egg white and yolk, keeping only the yolk.", "start_char": 17, "end_char": 33, "node_indices": [1, 2, 3], "edge_indices": [1, 2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 2, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "蛋黄中加入白糖", "text_en": "Add sugar to the egg yolk.", "start_char": 34, "end_char": 42, "node_indices": [2, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 3, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "几滴柠檬汁或醋", "text_en": "Add a few drops of lemon juice or vinegar to the egg yolk.", "start_char": 42, "end_char": 49, "node_indices": [2, 5], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 4, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "用电动打蛋器搅拌至颜色变浅", "text_en": "Use an electric beater to mix until the color becomes lighter.", "start_char": 50, "end_char": 63, "node_indices": [2, 6], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 5, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "牛奶倒入小锅", "text_en": "Pour the milk into a small pot.", "start_char": 65, "end_char": 71, "node_indices": [7, 8], "edge_indices": [6], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "小火加热至表面开始冒泡后关火", "text_en": "Heat over low heat until bubbles begin to appear on the surface, then turn off the heat.", "start_char": 72, "end_char": 86, "node_indices": [7, 8, 9], "edge_indices": [6, 7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 7, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 7, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "将热牛奶慢慢倒入蛋黄液", "text_en": "Slowly pour the hot milk into the egg-yolk mixture.", "start_char": 87, "end_char": 98, "node_indices": [6, 9], "edge_indices": [8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "同时快速搅拌，避免蛋黄结块", "text_en": "At the same time, stir quickly to prevent the egg yolk from forming lumps.", "start_char": 99, "end_char": 112, "node_indices": [6, 10], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 9, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 9, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "将蛋奶液倒回小锅", "text_en": "Pour the egg-and-milk mixture back into the small pot.", "start_char": 117, "end_char": 125, "node_indices": [10, 11], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 10, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "加入少量盐", "text_en": "Add a small amount of salt.", "start_char": 126, "end_char": 131, "node_indices": [11, 12], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 11, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 11, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "小火加热并持续快速搅拌，直到液体微微煮开", "text_en": "Heat over low heat until the liquid just begins to boil, stirring continuously and quickly.", "start_char": 132, "end_char": 153, "node_indices": [10, 11, 13], "edge_indices": [10, 12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 10, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 12, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 12, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "持续快速搅拌", "text_en": "Stir continuously and quickly.", "start_char": 137, "end_char": 143, "node_indices": [13, 14], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 13, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "关火放凉", "text_en": "Turn off the heat and let the mixture cool.", "start_char": 153, "end_char": 157, "node_indices": [14, 15], "edge_indices": [14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 14, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 14, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "淡奶油打发至约九分发", "text_en": "Whip the cream until it is approximately nine-tenths whipped.", "start_char": 162, "end_char": 172, "node_indices": [16, 17], "edge_indices": [15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 15, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "将打发好的淡奶油加入冷却后的蛋奶液", "text_en": "Add the whipped cream to the cooled egg-and-milk mixture.", "start_char": 177, "end_char": 194, "node_indices": [15, 17], "edge_indices": [16], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 16, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 16, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir until evenly combined.", "start_char": 195, "end_char": 199, "node_indices": [15, 18], "edge_indices": [17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 17, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S017", "text": "倒入带盖容器", "text_en": "Pour into a container with a lid.", "start_char": 200, "end_char": 206, "node_indices": [18], "edge_indices": [], "node_action_pairs": []}, {"id": "S018", "text": "冷冻至少 3 小时", "text_en": "Freeze for at least 3 hours.", "start_char": 207, "end_char": 216, "node_indices": [18, 19], "edge_indices": [18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 18, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}],
